  "query_preview": "..\n(Thursday through next Tuesday)\nIssued at 956 PM CDT Mon Sep 14 2026\n\nWe'll be stuck in this hot and dry pattern through at least the \nend of the week. Low-end PoPs remain confined to the Plateau, \nleaving the rest of Middle TN with upper 90s temperatures and no \nrain to provide any relief. The upper level pattern finally begins\nto flatten out a bit as we move into the weekend. In the absence \nof such prominent ridging aloft, temperatures naturally trend back\ntoward normal, finally dropping back below 90 degrees after the \npassage of a bonafide cold front on Monday. Tuesday continues on \nthe wetter and cooler trend, finally ushering in the first taste \nof fall.",
